From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 21:10:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Reflow the storybook font stack the fork reordered

Moving the emoji families behind the generic fallback left the pre/code
stack wrapped where the formatter would not have wrapped it, so the file
failed the format check. Upstream's own copy passes, which makes this ours
rather than the pre-existing documentation churn it was sitting alongside
and being mistaken for.

Wrapping only; the font order is untouched.
---
 packages/shared-components/.storybook/app-web-root.css | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/shared-components/.storybook/app-web-root.css b/packages/shared-components/.storybook/app-web-root.css
index 4511efd83e..42ead265e2 100644
--- a/packages/shared-components/.storybook/app-web-root.css
+++ b/packages/shared-components/.storybook/app-web-root.css
@@ -38,8 +38,7 @@ Please see LICENSE files in the repository root for full details.
         pre,
         code {
             font-family:
-                "Fira Code", "Courier", monospace, "Twemoji", "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji",
-                "Noto Color Emoji";
+                "Fira Code", "Courier", monospace, "Twemoji", "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Noto Color Emoji";
             font-size: 100% !important;
         }
     }
